/scripts/__pycache__
# The finished listing images (card S2). They are a pure function of the seed,
# the shot list and the app, and `scripts/store-frame.py` rebuilds them from
# `.shots/` in a minute — so the repository keeps the words, which are worth
# reviewing in a diff, and not the two megabytes of PNG, which are not. Card
# S4's workflow regenerates them on the runner and attaches them to the run for
# a human to look at before anything reaches Play.
/store/metadata/en-US/images
